d1.mp3"}},{"text":"사람은커녕","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；은커녕：表示“别说……，连……都……”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람은커녕","audio":"/audio/e13e594f3fd1f9b86a68.mp3"}},{"text":"동양인도","meaning":"东方人。","explanation":"동양인：东方人。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"동양인","audio":"/audio/c531f8ba74e8e99cec8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14809","senseId":"1","lemma":"동양인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동양인도","audio":"/audio/7f24a35385a7fcecd391.mp3"}},{"text":"거의","meaning":"几乎，快要","explanation":"거의：几乎，快要","readings":[{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60090","senseId":"2","lemma":"거의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아볼","meaning":"查找，翻找","explanation":"찾아보다：查找，翻找；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"찾아보다","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29758","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아볼","audio":"/audio/2e020bd34448eb8a731b.mp3"}},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수가","audio":"/audio/6780a417c9a853af476b.mp3"}},{"text":"없었어.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없었어","audio":"/audio/878f405278d830a29ede.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"c531f8ba74e8e99c","term":"동양인","zh":"东方人。","audio":"/audio/c531f8ba74e8e99cec8a.mp3","entryId":"14809","definition":"东方人。","pronunciation":["동양인"]},{"id":"1b1da423b101b551","term":"거의","zh":"几乎，快要","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3","entryId":"60090","definition":"离某个状态或限度很近。","pronunciation":["거의","거이"]},{"id":"a3eafbcd1004a6ce","term":"찾아보다","zh":"查找，翻找","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3","entryId":"29758","definition":"为了得到想要的信息而仔细观察。","pronunciation":["차자보다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3b792d88d5dd47ec2c8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.507,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14809","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":114,"sequenceScore":2.9837,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那个国家真的没多少韩国人吗？","嗯，别说韩国人了，就连东方人也几乎见不到。","我本来想学习一会儿的，但是太困了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个国家真的没多少韩国人吗？","嗯，别说韩国人了，就连东方人也几乎见不到。","我本来想学习一会儿的，但是太困了。"],"answer":1}]}
